{"id": "EUVD-2026-86395", "enisaUuid": "487f703d-a9e9-3de0-bded-fbd80a45c92f", "description": "ServiceNow has remediated an improper access control security issue that was identified in the ServiceNow AI Platform. This security issue could enable an unauthenticated user, in certain circumstances, to create, modify, or delete instance data beyond what was intended.\n\n\n\n\n\nIn August 2026, ServiceNow deployed a security update to hosted instances and ServiceNow provided the update to our partners and self-hosted customers. We are not currently aware of malicious exploitation against ServiceNow instances. We recommend customers promptly apply appropriate updates or upgrade to a patched release if they have not already done so.", "datePublished": "2026-09-24T18:42:40", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-24T19:18:52", "baseScore": 8.7, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:N/VI:H/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://support.servicenow.com/kb?id=kb_article_view&sysparm_article=KB3159623"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-86858", "GHSA-g4fh-c3m5-g3pg"], "assigner": "SN", "epss": 0.27, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "1a3a4ab8-4162-36b3-bc07-fea13d48b24a", "product": {"name": "ServiceNow AI Platform", "vendor": {"name": "Servicenow"}}, "product_version": "0 <Australia Patch 5"}, {"id": "6b028173-05d1-3aa3-9f38-dde6c6812f62", "product": {"name": "ServiceNow AI Platform", "vendor": {"name": "Servicenow"}}, "product_version": "0 <Australia Patch 4 Hot Fix 3"}, {"id": "aa7c4c50-5278-3459-bf69-28bb2c382d8f", "product": {"name": "ServiceNow AI Platform", "vendor": {"name": "Servicenow"}}, "product_version": "0 <Zurich Patch 10 Hot Fix 3b"}, {"id": "afd03e04-ad97-3f7b-bdd2-b993150fb610", "product": {"name": "ServiceNow AI Platform", "vendor": {"name": "Servicenow"}}, "product_version": "0 <Yokohama Patch 13 Hot Fix 5a"}, {"id": "b5752786-3bef-3fc4-8065-6ccb6b6a6b5a", "product": {"name": "ServiceNow AI Platform", "vendor": {"name": "Servicenow"}}, "pr